<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- U+0323: dotaccent shifted below the baseline.
     BelowDotShiftY is -(cap height + 160): -(708 + 160) = -868.
     All current Somerville masters have a cap height of 708.
     Component alignment is disabled to preserve the vertical offset.
     Mark/Nonspacing controls the exported advance. Both sidebearing keys
     reference dotaccent and are synchronized on every layer after positioning. -->
